 dict(id='the-tcu-leap',era='2018 · FORT WORTH, TEXAS',year='04',title='Belief travels\nboth ways.',summary='TCU offered more than a new runway. It offered people who believed in Chenge before the breakthrough everyone could see.',storyTitle='Why he chose TCU',story='In his 2021 TCU Magazine interview, Chenge recalled the university offering a full scholarship when he was jumping around 15.65m. He valued that early belief. His first NCAA outdoor season ended with fifth place and 16.42m in 2018. Learning to compete in a deeper field was its own step forward.',extra='Photograph from the later TCU years; used as an archive portrait, not as documentation of the 2018 meet.',photos=['tcu-composure'],sourceIds=['tcu-interview','tcu-bio']),
